<title>USA: TABLE - ErgoBilt Q2 results.</title>
<headline>TABLE - ErgoBilt Q2 results.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>For the Second Quarter ended June 30, 1997 and 1996</p>
<p>			     (unaudited)</p>
<p>(Dollars In Thousands)</p>
<p>				Three Months Ended  Six Months Ended</p>
<p>				     June 30,	    June 30,</p>
<p>			    Actual  Pro forma  Pro forma  Pro forma</p>
<p>			     1997	 1996	 1997	 1996</p>
<p> Sales		    $5,964     $3,850    $10,636     $7,432</p>
<p> Cost of Sales	   3,346	2,054	5,831	4,082</p>
<p> Gross Profit	    2,618	1,795	4,805	3,350</p>
<p>Selling, general and</p>
<p>administrative expenses</p>
<p>			     1,589	1,319	3,148	2,816</p>
<p> Operating Income	1,029	  476	1,657	  535</p>
<p>Interest and Other</p>
<p>Expense (Income), net</p>
<p>				(14)	   28	 (11)	   66</p>
<p>Income before income taxes</p>
<p>			     1,043	  448	1,668	  469</p>
<p>Income tax expense (benefit)</p>
<p>				 386	  174	  626	  173</p>
<p> Net Income		  657	  274	1,042	  296</p>
