<p>and common equivalent</p>
<p>shares outstanding</p>
<p>			 6,061,398  5,534,000  6,018,271  5,534,000</p>
<p>Pro forma results for three periods represented were calculated as if BodyBilt were a subsidiary of Ergobilt during the 1996 second quarter and six months, and for the full six months of 1997.  Pro forma results are used for comparison purposes  as the acquisition of Bodybilt by Ergobilt did not actually take place until February 1997.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
